<title>MOROCCO: Moroccan king pardons 577 prisoners.</title>
<headline>Moroccan king pardons 577 prisoners.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco's King Hassan on Tuesday pardoned 577 prisoners to mark the 44th anniversary of the Revolution of the King and the People which put an end to the French protectorate.</p>
<p>The official news agency MAP, quoting a Justice Ministry statement, said the amnesty included 241 prisoners who had their sentences quashed and 332 whose terms were reduced. Others had fines quashed.</p>
<p>The anniversary on Wednesday is a public holiday.</p>
</text>
